docs/security.md:44:| 1 | Capability-Based Security | `openfang-types` | Unauthorized actions by agents |
docs/security.md:45:| 2 | WASM Dual Metering | `openfang-runtime` | Infinite loops, CPU DoS |
docs/security.md:46:| 3 | Merkle Audit Trail | `openfang-runtime` | Tampered audit logs |
docs/security.md:47:| 4 | Taint Tracking | `openfang-types` | Prompt injection, data exfiltration |
docs/security.md:48:| 5 | Ed25519 Manifest Signing | `openfang-types` | Supply chain attacks |
docs/security.md:49:| 6 | SSRF Protection | `openfang-runtime` | Server-Side Request Forgery |
docs/security.md:50:| 7 | Secret Zeroization | `openfang-runtime`, `openfang-channels` | Memory forensics, key leakage |
docs/security.md:51:| 8 | OFP Mutual Auth | `openfang-wire` | Unauthorized peer connections |
docs/security.md:52:| 9 | Security Headers | `openfang-api` | XSS, clickjacking, MIME sniffing |
docs/security.md:53:| 10 | GCRA Rate Limiter | `openfang-api` | API abuse, denial of service |
docs/security.md:54:| 11 | Path Traversal Prevention | `openfang-runtime` | Directory traversal attacks |
docs/security.md:55:| 12 | Subprocess Sandbox | `openfang-runtime` | Secret leakage via child processes |
docs/security.md:56:| 13 | Prompt Injection Scanner | `openfang-skills` | Malicious skill prompts |
docs/security.md:57:| 14 | Loop Guard | `openfang-runtime` | Stuck agent tool loops |
docs/security.md:58:| 15 | Session Repair | `openfang-runtime` | Corrupted LLM conversation history |
docs/security.md:59:| 16 | Health Endpoint Redaction | `openfang-api` | Information leakage |
