docs/mcp-a2a.md:169:Each OpenFang agent becomes an MCP tool named `openfang_agent_{name}` (with hyphens replaced by underscores). The tool accepts a single `message` string parameter and returns the agent's response.
docs/mcp-a2a.md:171:For example, an agent named `code-reviewer` becomes the MCP tool `openfang_agent_code_reviewer`.
